{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣年度盛事《第61屆金鐘獎戲劇類頒獎典禮》昨晚於台北流行音樂中心舉行，賽果出人意表，入圍迷你劇視后的舒淇與李心潔雙雙落敗，瑞瑪席丹爆冷得獎，年屆80歲的秦漢則勇奪迷你劇視帝，至於楊祐寧入圍6次終成功破蛋，勇奪男配角獎，可喜可賀！</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24.642061+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T16:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.114435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.114435+00:00","content_hash":"ccfc6070959a3bc7b79ee1a03c688c29b2431c95638dbe38aa7906a03dbd2edc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}